WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:06,460
Li Mu

2
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,460
Why are you here alone?

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,460
Where are your teammates?

4
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:09,460
I thought they were all killed

5
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,460
I was just trying to get you to join the team.

6
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,460
No need to form a team

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:15,460
I'm here to tell you to leave this area immediately.

8
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,460
We go first to second

9
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,460
Your fighting hands are bloody

10
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,460
At night, it will cause troubles to the longevity group and the east shadow.

11
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,460
Why

12
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,460
What if we don’t leave? Li Mu

13
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,460
Even if you are number one on the freshman list

14
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,460
It’s not your turn to take care of our Zayin, right?

15
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:27,460
Anyway, a classmate

16
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:29,460
Do you have to do it so absolutely?

17
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,070
I'm curious

18
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:33,070
The school doesn’t offer fake classes either.

19
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,070
Where did you learn this hypocrisy?

20
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:35,070
It's so pretentious

21
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:37,070
In fact, I'm testing to see if there's anyone behind me.

22
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:39,070
There are only two roads before you now

23
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,070
Either start a war

24
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:41,070
Either take people and evacuate

25
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,070
one minute later

26
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:43,070
I'll take action directly

27
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:44,070
Pack your gear

28
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:46,070
Let's go, brother

29
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,170
He is alone

30
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:49,170
We fight five to one, afraid that he will shut up.

31
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:55,690
Listen to my advice

32
00:00:55,690 --> 00:01:00,210
Come out

33
00:01:00,210 --> 00:01:01,210
Calculate their reality

34
00:01:01,210 --> 00:01:02,210
Just one more second of hesitation

35
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:05,210
Let them all be buried here, brother

36
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:06,210
Five against one is a sure win game

37
00:01:06,210 --> 00:01:08,210
This is too cowardly and stupid.

38
00:01:08,210 --> 00:01:10,210
The ghost tiger keeps attracting you by its side

39
00:01:10,210 --> 00:01:11,210
Once the war breaks out

40
00:01:11,210 --> 00:01:13,210
He can replace one of us in an instant

41
00:01:13,210 --> 00:01:15,560
His teammates lurked in the cave again

42
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:16,560
Real fight

43
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:18,560
Our whole team can tell you here

44
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,560
Brother Yingming

45
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:22,560
When you should bow your head, you have to bow your head.

46
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:25,980
Who told you that I have to bow to Li Mo? Remember

47
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:27,980
to deal with someone

48
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:29,980
It’s not just a tough fight
